lesson: 129
title: Sisters and brothers
level: primary-1
stars: 2
explain: A girl does not count herself among her own sisters. If Ola has 2 sisters, there are 3 girls in the family: Ola and her 2 sisters.
explain: So Ola's brother has 3 sisters, one more than Ola has.
vars: s=2..6 y=3..6
answer: s + 1
exercise: A girl has {s} sisters and {y} brothers. How many sisters does each of her brothers have?
exercise: A girl has {s} sisters and {y} brothers. How many daughters do her parents have?
exercise: In a family each girl has {s} sisters. How many girls are there in the family?
exercise: Ola has {s} sisters and {y} brothers. How many sisters does her brother Max have?
exercise: Each of the girls in a family has {s} sisters and {y} brothers. How many girls are in the family?
test: Max says: "I have {y-1} brothers." His sister Ola says: "I have {s} sisters." How many sisters does Max have?
test: How many girls are in a family where one of the daughters has {s} sisters and {y} brothers?
test: There are {y} boys in a family. One of their sisters says she has {s} sisters. How many sisters does each boy have?
exercise: A girl has {s} sisters and {y} brothers. How many sisters has each brother got?
exercise: How many daughters do the parents have if one of their girls has {s} sisters and {y} brothers?
exercise: Every girl in a family in Ohio has {s} sisters. How many girls does the family have?
exercise: Emma has {s} sisters and {y} brothers. How many sisters does her brother Jack have?
exercise: In a family from Cork, each daughter has {s} sisters and {y} brothers. How many daughters are there?
exercise: Lily lives in Brisbane with her {s} sisters and {y} brothers. How many sisters does each of Lily's brothers have?
exercise: A boy's sister has {s.words} sisters. How many sisters does the boy have?
exercise: Ava has {s} sisters. Her brother Noah has {y-1} brothers. How many girls are there in the family?
test: Liam has {y-1} brothers. His sister Sophie has {s} sisters. How many sisters does Liam have?
test: A farmer in Saskatchewan has some daughters and {y} sons. Each daughter has {s} sisters. How many daughters does the farmer have?
test: {y} brothers share a house in Leeds with their sisters. One sister says she has {s} sisters. How many sisters does each brother have?
test: Grace has {s} sisters. How many girls are there in the family, counting Grace?
test: The boys in a family in Wellington all have the same sisters. One of the girls has {s} sisters. How many sisters does a boy have?
test: Chloe has {s.words} sisters and {y.words} brothers. How many daughters does her mother have?
exercise: girl's got {s} sisters n {y} bros. how many sisters each bro got
exercise: Mia's got {s+1}, no wait, {s} sisters, and {y} brothers. how many daughters her mum got
exercise: Ola has {s} sisters. Max, her bro, says he's got {s} sisters too. nah that's wrong innit, how many sisters Max got
exercise: every girl in the fam got {s} sisters, they live like {y+2} km from school. how many girls
test: Zoe's got {s} sisters, how many girls in the fam counting her
test: {y} boys, one of their sisters says she got {s+2} sisters, sorry, {s}. how many sisters each boy got
test: my mate reckons a girl with {s} sisters n {y} bros means her bro has {s+y} sisters cos u add em. nah, how many sisters the bro actually got
exam: It is given that a girl has {s} sisters and {y} brothers. Determine the number of sisters possessed by each of her brothers.
exam: Whereas a girl has {s.words} sisters and {y.words} brothers, ascertain the number of daughters born to her parents.
exam: In a certain family each girl has exactly {s} sisters. State the number of girls in the said family.
exam: Compute the total number of female children in a family wherein a daughter has {s} sisters and {y} brothers.
exercise: Grandma passed away, and all her grandchildren from one family came to say goodbye: a girl, her {s} sisters and her {y} brothers. How many girls from that family came?
exercise: Mum had a "happy accident" last year, a baby girl. Now a girl has {s} sisters, counting the baby, and {y} brothers. How many daughters do her parents have?
test: my mate's lot is "a handful", no kidding: she's got {s} sisters and {y} brothers. how many sisters has each of her brothers got
